        {
          "resource_id": "monster_action",
          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Debilitating Strike"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "Trigger: Nai Yan Fei hits a flat-footed creature and deals damage\n\nNai Yan Fei applies one of the following debilitations, which lasts until the end of her next turn.\n\n- **Debilitation** The target takes a \u201310-foot status penalty to its Speeds.\n- **Debilitation** The target becomes enfeebled 1.\n- **Debilitation** The target can't flank other creatures, and it can't provide flanking for its allies.\n- **Debilitation** The target doesn't gain a circumstance bonus to AC from Raising a Shield, lesser cover, or standard cover; it gains only a +2 circumstance bonus to AC from greater cover or Taking Cover."
            },
